# Form 005 Property Transfer Receipt layout (Annex A-5)

Source of truth: `Form 005 - Property Transfer Receipt.docx` — SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex A-5.
Do not invent columns or portal chrome on the official document.

## Document title

`SETUP Form 005 - Property Transfer Receipt`

Mixed case. Do **not** force uppercase via CSS.

## Page

- A4 portrait. Margins: **1 in (25.4 mm)** all sides (Word `pgMar` 1440).
- Body: Arial ~11pt. Black text only.
- `@page property-transfer-receipt-sheet` footer:

`SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex A-5: SETUP Form 005 - Property Transfer Receipt Page ` + `counter(page)` / `counter(pages)`

## Structure (exact Word order)

1. Title
2. Entity Name + Fund Cluster (same line)
3. From / To Accountable Officer; PTR No.; Date
4. Transfer Type (check only one): Donation | Relocate | Reassignment | Other (Specify)
5. Property table: Date Acquired | Property No. | Description | Amount | Condition of PPE
6. At least 10 blank data rows (pad); grow if more filled rows
7. Reason for Transfer: narrative text (underlined value line; default for completion: "Physical Transfer Only")
8. Approved by (Signature / Printed Name / Designation / Date)
9. Released/Issued by; Received by

## Preview vs print (100% fidelity)

- Preview **mounts** `PropertyTransferReceiptDocument` — same markup as print.
- Print re-renders via `createRoot` (`printPropertyTransferReceiptPdf`). Do **not** clone preview DOM.
- No logo / Republic header / Application ID on the official document.

## Responsive (portal UI only)

- Editor: `FORM_GRID_2` / `FORM_GRID_3`, stacked property-row cards on mobile, `ACTION_ROW` flex-wrap for Sync / Edit / Print.
- Preview: `official-doc-preview-shell` + horizontal scroll on narrow viewports (`officialFormScreen.css` `#property-transfer-receipt-preview`).

## Print path

In-page `window.print()` to `#property-transfer-receipt-print-root` + `body.property-transfer-receipt-printing`.

